lib/managoat/, priv/, test/managoat/, test/support/ and test/live/ are
vendored from three Apache-2.0 libraries, each Copyright (c) 2026 Jake Gaylor
and each extracted from Fountain (https://github.com/managoat/fountain) under
its decisions/0037. Their repositories are archived; the code was copied from
the last commit of each:

  Managoat.Sandbox  (managoat_sandbox 0.5.6)
    https://github.com/managoat/managoat_sandbox @ 7729241
    Kept: the behaviour, the facade and the Sprites adapter.
    Left out: the E2B and Daytona adapters and their tests, and E2B's live test.

  Managoat.Runtimes (managoat_runtimes 0.5.7)
    https://github.com/managoat/managoat_runtimes @ 395bc8c
    Kept: all four runtimes (claude, codex, gemini, opencode) and priv/.

  Managoat.ACP      (managoat_acp 0.6.0)
    https://github.com/managoat/managoat_acp @ 52b591f
    Left out: Managoat.ACP.Tracer (OpenTelemetry spans) and its test.

Each library's Testing.* modules moved from lib/ to test/support/, so they
compile for tests only. Beyond that, the changes are: Managoat.Sandbox's
default adapter map names Sprites alone; the gemini session script is read
from goatherd's priv/ at compile time; module docs that named a removed part
or a library README say so; and the tests that exercised E2B or Daytona
through the facade lost those cases. `diff -r` against the commits above
shows each.
